#: ../../docs/installation.md:1 7b16a83d262d422ea7a25fa5e0ee1d47
msgid "Installation"
msgstr "安装"

#: ../../docs/installation.md:4 d607e4b4a4c74cb698c282df5cddb79c
msgid "Pybes3 requires Python 3.9 or higher."
msgstr "Pybes3 需要 Python 3.9 或更高版本。"

#: ../../docs/installation.md:7 a61749c9cfa544fc9a104801aa784562
msgid "Install Pybes3 using pip"
msgstr "使用 pip 安装 Pybes3"

#: ../../docs/installation.md:13 6c9905d4560349258d59c5810ed2543c
msgid "Users on lxlogin server"
msgstr "lxlogin 服务器上的用户"

#: ../../docs/installation.md:15 2a919ab9aeb34dc9b35d30bc3804d8e6
msgid ""
"\"lxlogin server\" refers to the login server of IHEP computation "
"clusters. If you are not using the lxlogin server, you can skip this "
"section."
msgstr "「lxlogin server」指 IHEP 计算集群的登录服务器。若你不使用 lxlogin 服务器，可以跳过本节。"

#: ../../docs/installation.md:17 cc2e93fa78d244de8d3e7ce8e0e59bc9
msgid ""
"Since there is a quota limitation on the user's home directory (`~/`), "
"you need to create symbolic links for `~/.local` and `~/.cache`, which "
"contain pip packages and caches installed in \"user mode\":"
msgstr ""
"由于用户主目录（`~/`）存在配额限制，需要为 `~/.local` 和 `~/.cache` 创建符号链接，它们存放以「用户模式」安装的 pip"
" 包与缓存："

#: ../../docs/installation.md:35 ddffe19b8b604dfc9086aa78509cc534
msgid "Using Pybes3 under `BOSS8` environment"
msgstr "在 `BOSS8` 环境中使用 Pybes3"

#: ../../docs/installation.md:37 f418aa73f03f43d9bd9a931cb0f37a59
msgid ""
"If you are using Pybes3 under a `BOSS8` environment, you **must** run the"
" following commands after setting up the `BOSS8` environment:"
msgstr "如果要在 `BOSS8` 环境下使用 Pybes3，**必须**在完成 `BOSS8` 环境设置后执行以下命令："

#: ../../docs/installation.md:45 cece556c7fb949c6a56a4de096841b43
msgid ""
"Do **not** add these commands to your shell configuration file (e.g., "
"`~/.bashrc`), since they will conflict with the default Python "
"environment (without `BOSS8`)."
msgstr "**不要**把这些命令写进 shell 配置文件（如 `~/.bashrc`），否则会与（未加载 `BOSS8` 的）默认 Python 环境冲突。"

